A||N||4||Vlad||Aero front fascia swap...||||4||
Z||000000||Vlad||09-04-2000||02:50 AM||||Hi there...<P>When I bought my Fiero and brought it to my mechanic, he said he wanted to have the same car. And what? In a week or two he got 86 SE with 40k miles on it. However, he wants a GT front so he asked me if he can put the front bumper assembly from GT on 86 SE?<BR>What should I answer?<BR>Any idea?||||reg||4
Z||000001||WKDFIRO||09-04-2000||02:54 AM||||Check out the threads relating to it but All of the noses are interchangeable! I put a Formula nose and tail on my 85 GT.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||rockcrawl||09-04-2000||09:20 AM||||The 86 SE should already have the same front fascia as the GT.||||reg||1
Z||000003||contra||09-04-2000||06:11 PM||||you can do it <BR>i converted an 85 se to an 85GT<BR>full front back, fascias were needed<BR>wheel wells<BR>door skins with ground effects<BR>fenders with ground effects<BR>and bumper padding on the inside etc.<P>If you're converting the 86 to the aero nose you'll need the fascia, the bumper padding, and two support plastic pads, there is a lower spoiler you'll need to fit in (it's a B*tch to get out if there is rust there), and if you dont already have ground effects, you'll need new wheel wells.<BR>good luck<BR>any help i can provide email me at <P>contra@infinity.net<P>thanx<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Haze_Performance||09-04-2000||06:40 PM||||I may be missing something, but dosent the 86SE have a GT type nose already??<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">    <B>1985 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A></B><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 09-04-2000).]||||reg||4
